<item>
            <title>[PARQUET-329] ThriftReadSupport#THRIFT_COLUMN_FILTER_KEY was removed (incompatible change)</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PARQUET-329</link>
                <project id="12315521" key="PARQUET">Parquet</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/parquet-mr/commit/7fc7998398373a14b4cdc0ce18abdeb221b1ccf9#diff-3ee627775fa8e0fa756a09270bdbc26dL50&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;This&lt;/a&gt; renames, and so removes, a public field. It could possibly break apps.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="12843960">PARQUET-329</key>
            <summary>ThriftReadSupport#THRIFT_COLUMN_FILTER_KEY was removed (incompatible change)</summary>
                <type id="1" iconUrl="https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/viewavatar?size=xsmall&amp;avatarId=21133&amp;avatarType=issuetype">Bug</type>
                                            <priority id="3" iconUrl="https://issues.apache.org/jira/images/icons/priorities/major.svg">Major</priority>
                        <status id="5" iconUrl="https://issues.apache.org/jira/images/icons/statuses/resolved.png" description="A resolution has been taken, and it is awaiting verification by reporter. From here issues are either reopened, or are closed.">Resolved</status>
                    <statusCategory id="3" key="done" colorName="green"/>
                                    <resolution id="1">Fixed</resolution>
                                        <assignee username="singhashish">Ashish Singh</assignee>
                                    <reporter username="singhashish">Ashish Singh</reporter>
                        <labels>
                    </labels>
                <created>Thu, 9 Jul 2015 20:28:57 +0000</created>
                <updated>Sun, 23 Jun 2024 03:27:35 +0000</updated>
                            <resolved>Sat, 11 Jul 2015 23:29:23 +0000</resolved>
                                    <version>1.8.0</version>
                                    <fixVersion>1.8.0</fixVersion>
                                        <due></due>
                            <votes>0</votes>
                                    <watches>3</watches>
                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="14621207" author="singhashish" created="Thu, 9 Jul 2015 20:30:26 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=rdblue&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;rdblue&quot;&gt;rdblue&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=alexlevenson&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;alexlevenson&quot;&gt;alexlevenson&lt;/a&gt; what do you guys think?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14621308" author="rdblue" created="Thu, 9 Jul 2015 21:34:20 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Yes, I think this is an incompatible change. Plus, the &lt;tt&gt;setProjectionPushdown&lt;/tt&gt; method at the end of &lt;tt&gt;ThriftReadSupport&lt;/tt&gt; has been removed. That&apos;s definitely incompatible.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=singhashish&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;singhashish&quot;&gt;singhashish&lt;/a&gt;, why wasn&apos;t this caught by semver?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14621309" author="rdblue" created="Thu, 9 Jul 2015 21:35:17 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Marking as a blocker for 1.8.0. Thanks for catching this before it was released, Ashish!&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14621355" author="singhashish" created="Thu, 9 Jul 2015 22:00:05 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=blue%40cloudera.com&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;blue@cloudera.com&quot;&gt;blue@cloudera.com&lt;/a&gt; the removed method was added back in later semver restore PR. I am not sure why semver did not catch this, but I will take a look at it.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14621392" author="singhashish" created="Thu, 9 Jul 2015 22:33:23 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=rdblue&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;rdblue&quot;&gt;rdblue&lt;/a&gt; looks like everything in o.a.parquet.hadoop.thrift is excluded for semver checks, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/parquet-mr/blob/master/pom.xml#L222&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;. Should this be removed?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14621423" author="rdblue" created="Thu, 9 Jul 2015 23:07:18 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I don&apos;t think that&apos;s correct. The read support should be part of the public API because we have public methods, like setProjectionPushdown there. &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=julienledem&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;julienledem&quot;&gt;julienledem&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=tianshuo&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;tianshuo&quot;&gt;tianshuo&lt;/a&gt;, do you agree that the ThriftReadSupport is public?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14623622" author="rdblue" created="Sat, 11 Jul 2015 23:29:23 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I&apos;ve merged Ashish&apos;s fix because it isn&apos;t intrusive, just a variable rename. I&apos;ve also gone ahead with the patch to remove o.a.p.hadoop.thrift from the exclusion list. It is currently compatible, so we can check compatibility and determine whether this is public later, though I&apos;m pretty sure it is public API.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17857292" author="rok" created="Sun, 23 Jun 2024 03:27:35 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;This issue has been migrated to &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/parquet-java/issues/1848&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;issue #1848&lt;/a&gt; on GitHub. Please see the &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PARQUET-2502&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;migration documentation&lt;/a&gt; for further details.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                    </comments>
